    "created_at": "2019-03-29T23:45:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-29T23:45:41Z",
    "body": "Per the CSS spec, I think these generally *shouldn't* work on form controls (since they're replaced elements), unless you can actually fully explain a form control using the CSS model.  So in the cases where they do work, I think the spec needs to specify how.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
