    "created_at": "2019-03-30T00:47:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-30T00:47:48Z",
    "body": "I think it's still unclear to what extent form controls are replaced elements. e.g. per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4143 a button acts as a replaced element in some aspects but not in others. Buttons aren't fully explainable with just the CSS model, yet ::before/::after work.\r\n\r\nForm controls are weird. 🙂",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
