    "created_at": "2019-03-30T14:06:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-30T14:06:42Z",
    "body": "> on form controls (since they're replaced elements)\r\n\r\nBut the HTML spec clearly lists them [under _Non-replaced_ elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#toc-rendering). Don't we need a common definition of what makes the element replaced?",
